/-!
# Component actions in the characteristic-two argument

This extension establishes the actual 1.1.5 local hypotheses at C_G(v),
the normalizer/centralizer action with its exact kernel and component
central quotient, and the marked central four-group construction.
It also supplies commutator generation and inner-action transport.

The remaining reduction must discharge the normalization and centralizer
premises using the full earlier component alternatives, exclude the small
and S₆ cases, and construct the paired Suzuki or normalized Sp₄ Borel
configurations. Those model reductions are not asserted by this module.
The parent retains the final 13.6.6 exclusion.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, combined manuscript of 1 March 2004,
proof of 13.6.6, printed pp.926–927.
-/
